{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：07:59 2026-08-23 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今日（23日）早上6時26分，牛頭角下邨貴亮樓一名女子墮樓，倒臥在大廈平台。救援人員接報趕到，惜女事主已當場死亡。警方在現場沒有檢獲遺書，證實女死者是76歲姓林女住戶，相信她由單位墮下，正調查事件原因。其死因有待驗屍後確定。</p>\n<p>據悉，林婦未婚，她於大約10年間一直獨居於貴亮樓單位。直至兩個月前她的妹妹去世後，她曾出現情緒困擾及妄想症狀。警方相信案件無可疑，交由牛頭角警區雜項調查隊跟進。</p>\n<img alt=\"墮樓的女事主當場死亡。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6cd38841956fa66fa38ff3d81abb636c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-23_at_07_24_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23145d6296d25d60be329e090b7578ea/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-23_at_07_24_40.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f61153a3fbf2b62bf6761dd94d94cf5c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-23_at_07_24_43_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場是牛頭角下邨貴亮樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edd3e632e1df0521e6e448ffdff41a20/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-23_at_07_24_43_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ea7f3e4037ae2917828f5c13c7575c1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-23_at_07_24_43.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c374c76a949e2b6ec4282b166a098eb2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-23_at_07_24_42.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0bbf1512b2f23c71f31e4129565cb8b5/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-23_at_07_24_41.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T07:18:41.052541+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}